{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"First-load hydration: replaces each "},{"code":"EntityStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with the on-disk rows."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"hydrate"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"into"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"state"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Takes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inout State"},{"type":"text","text":" because it runs "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"before the store exists","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"canonical launch sequence hydrates a plain value and hands the result to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Store(initialState:)"},{"type":"text","text":". There is no observer to race with, so there is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no lost-write hazard here. Use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/hydrate(into:)-2f2yq","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" if the store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is a